# The Akku archive builds the package as `git archive` does, and `akku
# install` unpacks all of it into every consumer's .akku/src/. Design
# records, agent instructions and the stage-0 spike stay in the repository
# and out of the package. `make check-archive` fails if any of them ships,
# or if anything else is left out.
/.plans export-ignore
/AGENTS.md export-ignore
/spike export-ignore
